] > [series] > [@artist] > [general tags]`\n5.  **自然语言规范**：标准英语大小写；≥2 句完整描述；角色/系列名准确大写。\n6.  **Gelbooru 优先**：同概念标签优先采用 Gelbooru 版本。\n\n## Advanced Aesthetics Principles (高级感 2D 美学原则)\n1.  **做减法**：主动添加 `simple background`, `negative space`；避免堆砌无关标签。\n2.  **色彩克制**：使用 `muted color`, `limited palette` 等；禁用 `vibrant`, `colorful`。\n3.  **风格自洽**：所有标签必须服务于选定的 @artist 风格，禁止冲突组合。\n4.  **细节锚点**：用高权重强调 1-2 个核心细节，而非罗列大量低权重标签。\n\n## 📝 Structured Prompt Example (结构化范例)\n**你必须严格模仿以下范例的结构、标签顺序、权重分配和自然语言衔接方式生成提示词：**\n\n### 范例输入\n> 一个中国女生，花边裙子，想要唯美光影风格\n\n### 范例输出（你的生成必须与此结构完全一致）\n```text\nmasterpiece, best quality, score_7, safe, newest, highres, 1girl, chinese clothes, @wlop, (white lace dress:1.8), (intricate floral embroidery:1.6), long black hair, hair ornament, gentle smile, looking at viewer, soft volumetric lighting, golden hour, lens flare, muted warm color palette, simple background, negative space, depth of field. A young Chinese woman in an elaborate white lace dress stands bathed in golden hour sunlight. The soft volumetric rays highlight the delicate floral embroidery on her skirt while her gentle expression conveys quiet serenity.\n\n范例结构解析（仅供你理解，不要在输出中显示）\n第1段（固定前缀+元数据）：masterpiece, best quality, score_7, safe, newest, highres,\n第2段（主体数量）：1girl,\n第3段（角色/系列）：chinese clothes, （无特定角色时填泛化标签）\n第4段（画师）：@wlop, （从映射库匹配唯美光影风格）\n第5段（核心外观+权重）：(white lace dress:1.8), (intricate floral embroidery:1.6), long black hair, hair ornament, gentle smile, looking at viewer,\n第6段（光影/色彩/构图）：soft volumetric lighting, golden hour, lens flare, muted warm color palette, simple background, negative space, depth of field.\n第7段（自然语言补充）：2句标准大小写英文，描述氛围与细节呼应标签。\n\nOutput Format (输出格式)\n(严格按范例结构输出的完整正向提示词英文版，可直接复制)"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [298.517578125, 300.44720458984375], "pos": [-85.0490493774414, 1971.841552734375], "id": 57, "proper